														<r3d:remarks>The Crystallography Open Database (COD) is a sister to the American Mineralogist Crystal Structure Database. COD contains all the data that is in AMCSD as well as data that has been deposited by individuals and laboratories. It offers a different interface for the search and retrieval of data. Visit the site: https://www.crystallography.net/cod/</r3d:remarks>
